<title>USA: Panamerican Beverages sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Panamerican Beverages sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panamerican Beverages Inc said on Friday it set a two-for-one stock split of its Class A and Class B common stock.</p>
<p>Panamerican also increased its pre-split quarterly dividend to $0.105 from $0.09, in U.S. dollars. On a post-split basis, the new dividend would be $0.0525.</p>
<p>Pan American shares closed at 56-3/8 on Friday, down more than a point for the day. Its 52-week high was 59-3/4.</p>
</text>
